---
// Illustrative guest ↔ concierge exchange for the fictional "Juniper House"
// used by GuidePhone. Mirrors the guest itinerary-chat story (US2.3 in the
// 260905-backend-services-spec intent): the itinerary is built only from the
// property's own local picks, never the whole internet.
---

<div
  class="chat"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Example conversation: a guest says they have Saturday morning, love coffee and an easy hike, and need to be back by 2 pm. The concierge replies with a three-stop itinerary drawn from the property's own local picks."
>
  <div class="chat-head" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="chat-avatar">
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
    </span>
    <div>
      <span class="chat-title">Your concierge</span>
      <span class="chat-sub">The Juniper House</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="chat-body" aria-hidden="true">
    <p class="bubble guest">
      We’ve got Saturday morning. We love good coffee and an easy hike, and need to be back by 2.
    </p>
    <div class="bubble concierge">
      <p>Here’s a relaxed plan, all within 15 minutes of the house:</p>
      <ol class="plan">
        <li>
          <span class="t">8:30</span>
          <span>
            <strong>Quail &amp; Ember Bakery</strong> · locals queue for the morning bun
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="t">9:30</span>
          <span>
            <strong>Ridge Loop trail</strong> · easy 2 mi, shaded, river views
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="t">12:00</span>
          <span>
            <strong>Alder Street Deli</strong> · picnic lunch, open until 3
          </span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <span class="chat-note">Built from your host’s local picks · hours checked this week</span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .chat {
    width: min(420px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .chat-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }

  .chat-avatar {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #b8472e;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 3px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .chat-avatar span {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fbf3ea;
  }

  .chat-avatar span:nth-child(2) {
    background: #f2b544;
  }

  .chat-title {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .chat-sub {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .chat-body {
    padding: 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .bubble {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    max-width: 88%;
  }

  .bubble.guest {
    align-self: flex-end;
    background: var(--band);
    color: var(--band-ink);
    border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
  }

  .bubble.concierge {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
  }

  .bubble.concierge p {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .plan {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .plan li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .plan strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .t {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .chat-note {
    align-self: flex-start;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    padding-left: 4px;
  }
</style>
